From 6697472dd33a420bef7ce729a9076ee25cba7124 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <assistant@local>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 05:34:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor: add global exception handling and response DTOs

- Add custom exceptions (ResourceNotFoundException, UnauthorizedAccessException,
  InvalidCredentialsException, InvalidStateException) mapped to proper HTTP
  status codes via @RestControllerAdvice
- Replace all raw RuntimeException usages in QueueService, TokenService,
  LoginService with the appropriate custom exception
- Add QueueResponseDto + QueueMapper; QueueController now returns DTOs
  instead of the raw Queue entity
- Fill in previously-empty TOKEN/Dto/ResponseDto and add TokenMapper;
  TokenController now returns DTOs instead of raw Token entities
- LoginController now returns ResponseEntity<LoginResponseDto> instead
  of a bare String
- Extract duplicated getCurrentAdmin() SecurityContext lookup into a
  single private helper in QueueService
- Unify login failure messages to avoid leaking whether a username exists
- Remove unused imports (org.apache.coyote.Response, unused TokenRepo
  import in TokenController, unused Optional import in TokenService)
